resent the body of land that consists of an island surrounded by an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"atoll: the inner island would be one ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNPolygon"},{"text":" object, while the surrounding","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"atoll would be another. You could also use a multipolygon shape to represent a","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"group of disconnected but related buildings."}],"role":"symbol"}}}